    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 146,
        "text": "We have over 17,000 islands across the archipelago, from sea to the mountains, including rainforest, mangrove area, peatland area, arid land area.",
