        "text": "supermarket without bills",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4563F18630",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 259,
        "text": "So I started Javara 15 years ago with the mission of bringing back forgotten food biodiversity to help Indigenous and smallholder food farmers to improve their lives, while also providing consumers with healthier diets, with products that are also ecological.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF12CE90E4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 229,
        "text": "So of course, I got to travel across Indonesia, spending time with Indigenous community, and to my surprise, places that are so remote and not even touched by the government policy, food policy programs, are well-fed and healthy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "42E5D2134C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 148,
        "text": "Yes, they may not have much cash, but they are [not] lacking of healthy, nutritious food, as long as the natural environment is not being destroyed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "066CC5F96B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
