          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C28F887AFE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 40,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "shade of the tree",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1007BB638F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 21,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "can grow under the shade of the tree, and it can easily",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "77D13DB59D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 41,
        "endOffset": 177,
        "text": "you don't need to destroy the forest, you don't need to poison our soil, and basically you don't even need to introduce new type of crop",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4657B2BEE1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 145,
        "text": "Unfortunately, the government, the policy for over four decades choose to ignore our food biodiversity, and instead monoculture of rice prevails.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3AD1F29A71",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "Over 98 percent of Indonesians are consuming rice right now.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "356225C09C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "Let's compare with 1954, where actually it was only 53 percent.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C792986A05",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "The rest was based on cassava, corn, sago and other edible roots.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5EADC40DE4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 26,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "embarrassing",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BBCB75D908",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 66,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "frustrating",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DC6FEB923E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 380,
        "text": "So I have to say, this is embarrassing, and at the same time very frustrating that a country like Indonesia where the food is abundant, we have such high rate on stunting and malnutrition, not to mention the impact of our food policy towards deforestation, land degradation, climate change, natural disasters, impoverishment of our farmers and also poor diet among the population.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "202A7A7221",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "We do have a vision, actually, on how the policy should be.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9E379F6B6B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "We need to shift from monoculture to food biodiversity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "278DF07D0D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 128,
        "text": "We need to revive back the heritage food that actually can provide good nutrition for all, while also keeping intact the nature.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8EE8EDA8C1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 28,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "center stage",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "334E55C18C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "It is time for us to give a center stage for the food biodiversity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BB299C0DC1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "To be able to find the solutions that we need.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ABC96C081A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 225,
        "text": "This is an example of a small village in Central Java, which decided to embark on a journey to nutrify its community, making sure that every household [has] a food garden, cultivating chicken, fish, vegetables, fruits, herbs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "86A4A7BFB1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 103,
        "endOffset": 135,
        "text": "improving their household income",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "23DA4A4752",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 151,
        "endOffset": 178,
        "text": "increasing class attendance",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0910A87BB5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 188,
        "endOffset": 216,
        "text": "improving the student grades",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E7A601921D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 217,
        "text": "And this is interesting because once they did that, they can reduce their grocery costs by 30 percent, improving their household income by 20 percent, increasing class attendance and also improving the student grades.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F3BD062728",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "So nutrition matters.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FBC7B2E947",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 37,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "nutrifying the community",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1A61DF803C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "Feeding the nation is one thing, but nutrifying the community goes a very long way.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F03A79040",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "So children [are] our future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9E28437A7D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 208,
        "endOffset": 335,
        "text": "to embrace their food culture identity, to understand the nutrition that they have and how our food relates with sustainability",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BD2C7449E4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 336,
        "text": "It is also time for the food policy to also include food culture education into our curriculum, teaching our children about where their food comes from, what [is] the food biodiversity available around them, to embrace their food culture identity, to understand the nutrition that they have and how our food relates with sustainability.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A7B02FFBD4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 152,
        "text": "So basically, if we can shift the policy to include food biodiversity, we can provide nutrition, good nutrition for all without jeopardizing our nature.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D31C5FAB3F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 33,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "in food biodiversity, in the mainstreaming of biodiversity",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "00D2AA6C79",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 158,
        "text": "It is time for us to invest more in food biodiversity, in the mainstreaming of biodiversity as [a] practical, inclusive [solution] for the future of our food.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5FFC412D19",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "Not only that we have a food policy crisis, we also have a food identity crisis.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "900338E1E8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 26,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "ripped off from our relationship",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0043CCD19B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "For decades, we have been ripped off from our relationship to culture and nature.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C247478A82",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 126,
        "endOffset": 204,
        "text": "to become the answer, and also to understand that it is the food of the future",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "375C7CEF18",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 205,
        "text": "We have to help the people to go through this crisis of identity, allowing them to understand the importance of heritage food to become the answer, and also to understand that it is the food of the future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EF22428CE7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 15,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "making it sexy and hyped",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2ACC68C613",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "Rebranding it, making it sexy and hyped so that it is no longer perceived as a poor man diet.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E668A0BED",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B9C1A99C3C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "94E3BF321C",
